<noinclude>
Simple TemplateStyles test template.

Usage:
* {{TestTemplate|Your label text}}
* {{TestTemplate|label=Named label|tone=success}}

Parameters:
* 1 or label = display text
* tone = neutral (default), success, warning, danger

Stylesheet:
* [[Template:TestTemplate/styles.css]]
</noinclude><includeonly><templatestyles src="TestTemplate/styles.css" />
<span class="ts-badge ts-badge--{{#switch:{{lc:{{{tone|neutral}}}}}|success=success|warning=warning|danger=danger|#default=neutral}}">{{{label|{{{1|TemplateStyles test label}}}}}</span></includeonly><noinclude></noinclude>
